on, trapped between the threat of the Safeguard and dwindling food supplies. A girl named Zuru goes on a journey to find food for her village, only to inadvertently cause doom when an observation tower senses her and summons a Safeguard pack to eliminate the threat. With her companions dead and all escape routes blocked, the only thing that can save her now is the sudden arrival of Killy the Wanderer, on his quest for the Net Terminal Genes, the key to restoring order to the world.\n\n(Source: Official Website)"},"tags":[{"name":"Full CGI","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Post-Apocalyptic","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cyborg","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Seinen","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Survival","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cyberpunk","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cosmic Horror","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":62,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Robots","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Artificial Intelligence","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Guns","rank":55,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"BLAME!","english":"BLAME!","native":"BLAME!","romaji":"BLAME!","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"特工次世代"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"ブラム"}]},"trailer":{"id":"bGGN8n5rQJY","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bGGN8n5rQJY/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}